CPEPrefix: unknown

Description:
Subzero is a fast, lightweight code generator originally developed for Portable
Native Client (PNaCl). SwiftShader uses an in-tree fork of Subzero as its
default Reactor JIT compiler backend in Chromium builds on x86, x86_64, ARM32,
and MIPS32.

Local Modifications:
Initially imported via git subtree from commit
fb705a6d55003b2c32772ae49e25b0babcff5acc and synced up to upstream
pnacl-subzero's final commit (a018d6e2dc9b3f0b1a48d1deade8160e44589189, after
which PNaCl was deprecated and upstream development ceased). Heavily modified
in-tree for SwiftShader Reactor integration, including adding CMakeLists.txt,
custom x86/ARM target lowering and intrinsics, Windows x86 ABI fixes, C++17
compatibility updates, sanitizer/compiler warning fixes, and security fixes
(such as alloca integer-overflow checks).
